{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19163","headline":"酬郓州令狐相公官舍言怀见寄兼呈乐天 · 刘禹锡","name":"酬郓州令狐相公官舍言怀见寄兼呈乐天","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"词人各在一涯居，声味虽同迹自疎。\n佳句传因多好事，尺题稀爲不便书。\n已通戎略逢黄石，仍占星文耀碧虚。\n闻说朝天在来岁，霸陵春色待行车。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19163.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19163","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}